                "user_id": "U0BTUQGHDDF"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ",\nThere's no issue with your selected streams. The DDL statements in the log ("
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "DROP TEMPORARY TABLE ... temp_order_summary_*",
                "style": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " and similar) are on other tables in the same MySQL instance, not on the tables you're syncing. OLake logs every DDL it sees in the binlog, which is why these lines show up, but they don't affect your sync or your data."
              }
            ]
          }
